FULL DESCRIPTION (Nexus "Description" field, BBCode):
[color=#f6b26b][size=4][b]Description[/b][/size][/color]
[color=#D4D4D8]<Hook paragraph: the pain point, then what the mod adds, in 2-4 sentences.>[/color]

[b][color=#f6b26b][size=4]Main features[/size][/color][/b]
[list]
[*][color=#D4D4D8]<Feature 1 — player-visible, one item per [*>].[/color][/*]
[*][color=#D4D4D8]<Feature 2.>[/color][/*]
[/list]
[color=#D4D4D8]What it does NOT do:[/color]

[list]
[*][color=#D4D4D8]No game files are edited. Disable the mod = 100% original game.[/color][/*]
[*][color=#D4D4D8]<No balance changes / no touch to X — whatever applies.>[/color][/*]
[/list]

[b][color=#f6b26b][size=4]Installation instructions[/size][/color][/b]
[list=1]
[*][color=#D4D4D8]Extract the archive into your game folder so that the [i][font=Courier New]WTE_QOL_Template[/font][/i] folder ends up inside [i][font=Courier New]<game>\mods\[/font][/i].[/color][/*]
[*][color=#D4D4D8]Enable the mod loader (once per game install): open [i][font=Courier New]<game>\js\plugins.js[/font][/i] in any text editor, find [i][font=Courier New]"name":"VirtualModLoader","status":false[/font][/i] and change [i][font=Courier New]false[/font][/i] to [i][font=Courier New]true[/font][/i]. Save the file.[/color][/*]
[*][color=#D4D4D8]Launch the game - the loader rebuilds its injector and reloads once on first run. Done.[/color][/*]
[/list]
[quote][color=#D4D4D8]Note: game updates and Steam's "verify integrity of game files" restore the original [font=Courier New]js\plugins.js[/font] (loader off) and wipe the [font=Courier New]mods\[/font] folder - after each update repeat step 2 and re-drop the mod.[/color][/quote]

[b][color=#f6b26b][size=4]Uninstall[/size][/color][/b]
[color=#d4d4d8]Delete the [/color][i][font=Courier New][color=#d4d4d8]WTE_QOL_Template[/color][/font][/i][color=#d4d4d8] folder from [/color][i][font=Courier New][color=#d4d4d8]mods\[/color][/font][/i][color=#d4d4d8] (or rename it to [/color][i][font=Courier New][color=#d4d4d8]!WTE_QOL_Template[/color][/font][/i][color=#d4d4d8] to temporarily disable).[/color]

[b][color=#f6b26b][size=4]Configuration[/size][/color][/b]
[color=#D4D4D8]<If the mod has a CONFIG: where it lives and what is in it. Otherwise delete this section.>[/color]

[b][color=#f6b26b][size=4]Troubleshooting[/size][/color][/b]
[color=#D4D4D8]The mod always writes a log to [i][font=Courier New]mods\WTE_QOL_Template\logs\mod_template.log[/font][/i]. If anything misbehaves, attach that file to your bug report - it records the mod version, <what else the log captures>, and any game errors.[/color]

